### Health
GET http://localhost:5001/health

### Get Watchlist
GET http://localhost:5001/api/stocks/watchlist

### Add a ticker
POST http://localhost:5001/api/stocks/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticker": "MSFT"}

### Get stored quotes for watchlist
GET http://localhost:5001/api/stocks/quotes

### Enqueue manual refresh
POST http://localhost:5001/api/stocks/refresh/MSFT
